# Rule Format Example 9: RULE/WHERE Form with Type Pattern
# Demonstrates the Rule1 syntax with rdf:type using the 'a' keyword.
# (The former Datalog `:-` form has been removed from SHACL 1.2 Rules.)

PREFIX ex: <http://example.org/>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>

# Infer animal classification
RULE {
    ?x a ex:Animal .
} WHERE {
    ?x a ex:Dog .
}
